    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist receives a possessed doll from an unknown sender and begins to suffer from recurring nightmares. This is a story about overcoming those terrifying experiences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of effects and direction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person perspective (VHS style)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content Warning</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudden scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing movements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(This game fully allows streaming, YouTube content creation, and monetization for both personal and commercial use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may freely use gameplay footage, create subtitles, and produce edited or transformative content without needing separate permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, misuse such as misrepresentation, malicious distortion, or illegal purposes (e.g. hate speech or political propaganda) is strictly prohibited.)</p>",
